    "confidence": 0.9,
    "explanation": "Both parties are told the same thing: the SGD 4.50 cancellation fee does not stand and is refunded in full to the rider.\n\nPOL-NS-01(d) decides it. EV-TRIP-02724 records the trip terminated by the driver at 21:27:08 under cancellation_reason_code DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE. POL-NS-01 recognises only RIDER_NO_SHOW, RIDER_UNREACHABLE and EXCESSIVE_WAIT for limb (d), and states expressly that DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE is the driver's own admission that he could not find the rider and does not satisfy limb (d). Limb (d) therefore fails. The driver's stationary fixes sit inside the 50 m STANDARD arrival radius (minimum distance 0.11 m, EV-GPS-02724), and for that case POL-NS-01 fixes the result itself: the fee is not chargeable, the rider receives the full refund, no driver compensation is payable, and the mis-selected reason code is recorded as a driver-education referral.\n\nIndependently, POL-NS-04 exonerates the rider. EV-CHAT-02724 shows her locating message 'at the lift lobby' sent at 21:24:45 inside the waiting window; the driver sent no reply within 120 seconds and placed no in-app call (trip_record.in_app_calls is empty) before cancelling at 21:27:08; and EV-GPS-02724 places her device within 13.8 m mean and 17.7 m maximum of the pin across all 43 of her qualifying fixes, inside the 100 m STANDARD rider-presence radius. All three limbs of POL-NS-04 hold.\n\nI accept the driver's arrival case on its own terms, and it is well made. EV-GPS-02724 shows a continuous 200-second in-geofence run from 21:23:45 to 21:27:05 with 21 qualifying fixes, satisfying POL-NS-02; the 'arrived' event at 21:23:45 coincides with the first qualifying fix, so there is no clock-skew problem under POL-NS-08(a); the 200-second dwell exceeds the 180-second free waiting period in force (trip_record.platform_policy.free_wait_sec = 180), so POL-NS-01 limbs (a), (b) and (c) hold; the arrival marker is not false under POL-NS-05 (stationary at 0.11 m from the pin at 0 kph); and the rider was present, so this is not a wrong-entrance case under POL-NS-03. None of that rescues the fee: limb (d) fails on the recorded reason code, and the driver's own statement confirms he 'could not locate the rider'.\n\nThe driver's claim to SGD 3.60 compensation is rejected. The anti-farming check indeed does not trip (1 no-show termination in 30 days against 120 completed trips, a rate of 0.008, both below POL-NS-07's thresholds), but POL-NS-07 pays only where POL-NS-01 is satisfied in full, and it is not. No driver compensation is payable.\n\nThe rider's POL-NS-06 shortfall claims are rejected. The measured dwell is 200 seconds, which exceeds the 180-second free waiting period by 20 seconds; the derived shortfall is -20.0 seconds, that is a surplus, not a shortfall. POL-NS-06 does not apply. The rider prevails on other grounds, so nothing turns on it.\n\nOn the money: EV-FARE-02724 shows the cancellation-fee line at SGD 4.50, total_charged SGD 4.50, payment_status CHARGED and refund_issued_sgd 0.00. That reconciles exactly with platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd of SGD 4.50, so there is no POL-NS-08(d) defect, and SGD 4.50 is the figure refunded — the cancellation-fee line only.\n\nNo escalation is warranted. Confidence is well above the 0.70 floor; the artifacts agree on arrival, dwell and rider presence; both disputes_with_counterparty_90d counters are 0 (POL-NS-09(c)); the anti-farming check and rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d (0) do not engage POL-NS-09(d); and no deciding fact rests on an impaired artifact (POL-NS-09(e)).\n\nThe two claims about the MISSING traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-02724-01 were discarded by the referee for citing a weight-0.0 artifact without naming its issue code, and in any event the single 200-second run already clears the minimum, so no dwell needs to be accumulated across intervals.\n\nConfidence is 0.90, against a cap of 1.0: the deciding facts are carried by EV-TRIP-02724, EV-GPS-02724, EV-CHAT-02724 and EV-FARE-02724, each at weight_multiplier 1.0. The refund's monetary effect (SGD 4.50) is below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of SGD 8.00, so it executes automatically on issue."
  },
